{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06769","headline":"何九於客舍集 · 王昌龄","name":"何九於客舍集","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"客有住桂阳，亦如巢林鸟。\n罍觞且终宴，功业曾未了。\n山月空霁时，江明高楼晓。\n门前泊舟檝，行次入松筱。\n此意投赠君，沧波风褭褭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06769.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06769","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}